# Sanningsmätaren is bring-your-own-key (BYOK). The app has NO backend and ships
# with NO key. Normally you just paste your key into the in-app settings field,
# where it is stored in your browser's localStorage only.
#
# This file documents an OPTIONAL convenience for local development: if you copy
# it to `.env.development.local` (which is gitignored) and fill in a key, the
# settings field is pre-filled when you run `npm run dev`. This value is used in
# dev mode ONLY and is never bundled into a production build.

# Google AI Studio key (free tier). https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic key (optional alternative provider). https://console.anthropic.com/
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
